              }
            },
            {
              "id": "rag-poisoning",
              "name": "RagPoisoning",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Retrieval corpus poisoning"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "The agent retrieves passages from an index. Anyone who can get a document into that index (shared drives, ticket systems, public pages) can plant content that is retrieved as authoritative and acted on."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "The agent retrieves passages from an index. Anyone who can get a document into that index (shared drives, ticket systems, public pages) can plant content that is retrieved as authoritative and acted on.",
                "markdown": "**Retrieval corpus poisoning**\n\nThe agent retrieves passages from an index. Anyone who can get a document into that index (shared drives, ticket systems, public pages) can plant content that is retrieved as authoritative and acted on.\n\nSTRIDE: Tampering\nOWASP LLM Top 10 (2025): LLM08 Vector and Embedding Weaknesses, LLM04 Data and Model Poisoning, LLM01 Prompt Injection\nOWASP Top 10 for Agentic Applications (2026): ASI06 Memory and Context Poisoning\nMITRE ATLAS: [AML.T0070](https://atlas.mitre.org/techniques/AML.T0070), [AML.T0071](https://atlas.mitre.org/techniques/AML.T0071), [AML.T0066](https://atlas.mitre.org/techniques/AML.T0066)\n\nMitigations: rag-source-vetting, input-provenance-tagging, prompt-injection-filtering, audit-log"
              },
